/* FMX styles embedded in the IDE, loaded with TStyleManager.TrySetStyleFromResource.
   Dark.style comes from RAD Studio's Redist\styles\Fmx (redistributable) and has
   no platform restriction, so it serves Windows and macOS alike. Changed in
   our copy: every orange or gold accent is blue (focus outlines, selections,
   check marks, sliders, the menu highlight), the scrollbar thumbs are neutral
   grey, and menu shortcut text (menuitemstyle's 'shortcut') is light grey;
   the original set no colour there, so shortcuts were nearly black on the
   dark menu. */
DARKSTYLE RCDATA "styles\\Dark.style"
